Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Metric variation and general field equation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"34abd9da-4b30-4ceb-91e3-be85282692f5"],

Cell["\<\
The variation is organized as E_{mu nu} = E^(EH)_{mu nu} + alpha E^(R2)_{mu \
nu} + beta E^(C2)_{mu nu}.  This is the same uncontracted Weyl-squared form \
used in Eq. (eom_quadratic) of the manuscript.  Keeping the three pieces \
separate makes each contribution inspectable and avoids the \
duplicated/undefined metric symbol in the original QG notebook.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6ade657f-9b82-46cb-a87b-cbc174743e1d"],

