Cell["\<\
The preceding grid explicitly gives delta g_nn = -2 Phi and delta g_hh = -2 \
Psi h.  In conformal coordinates this is ds^2 = a(eta)^2[-(1+2 Phi)deta^2 + \
(1-2 Psi) delta_ij dxi dxj].\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a0f30a6a-e652-4820-8922-96c35cc2fdb9"],

