scalar perturbation, including the density perturbation and velocity \
contribution.  It is displayed using the same nn/nh/hh grid notation as the \
original notebooks.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7c3fa6e6-5d7b-4c96-8962-1f07478a9919"],

