Cell["\<\
The Weyl tensor vanishes on the exact FLRW background.  Its first-order \
contribution is nevertheless nonzero and is precisely the source of the \
additional spin-2 dynamics in the scalar perturbation equations.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e14562bb-88a2-42f4-9165-4d18f1d83f13"]
}, Open  ]],

